626
01:24:21,423 --> 01:24:24,824
I 'm not Jasmin ! I 'm not Jasmin !

627
01:24:27,896 --> 01:24:31,423
I 'll kill them ! I 'll kill them all !

628
01:24:31,666 --> 01:24:36,103
