Beloved ... where are you ?

685
01:31:08,930 --> 01:31:15,893
Where are you ? Where are you ? Where are you ?

686
01:31:16,103 --> 01:31:23,703
Beloved ... my beloved

687
01:31:25,413 --> 01:31:33,718
From that world to this world , I came in search of you

688
01:31:33,988 --> 01:31:40,188
Beloved ... where are you ?

689
01:31:40,328 --> 01:31:47,461
Where are you ? Where are you ? Where are you ?

