Now you threaten these innocent kids

803
01:52:04,951 --> 01:52:06,441
What is it you want .. . ?

804
01:52:06,986 --> 01:52:10,979
Why have tormented me and kept me alive all these years ?

805
01:52:11,124 --> 01:52:15,527
Today is once again the same dark moonless night

806
01:52:15,662 --> 01:52:19,393
... for which I have waited so many years

807
01:52:19,766 --> 01:52:22,326
Try to remember it , Thakur

808
01:52:23,002 --> 01:52:28,736
Fifteen years ago today you killed my dark mistress Nakita

809
01:52:28,942 --> 01:52:33,879
And tonight I will sacrifice your daughter Jasmin

810
01:52:34,013 --> 01:52:37,881
And Nakita will be incarnated in the flesh once again

811
01:52:40,153 --> 01:52:42,087
You killed Nakita

812
01:52:42,222 --> 01:52:44,782
And now Nakita will kill you

813
01:52:45,158 --> 01:52:47,786
Nakita will emerge from the dark past

814
01:52:47,927 --> 01:52:50,725
And she will triumph over death forever

815
01:52:55,401 --> 01:52:57,335
Jasmin ...

816
01:52:58,671 --> 01:53:01,902
Now you are under my control

817
01:53:08,348 --> 01:53:11,977
You will do only what I command you to do

818
01:53:13,720 --> 01:53:17,178
Tonight I will sacrifice you

819
01:53:17,657 --> 01:53:20,956
And Nakita will be reborn once again

820
01:54:13,546 --> 01:54:16,344
- Why are you here ? - l 'm a horror film director

821
01:54:16,482 --> 01:54:17,608
We get everywhere

822
01:54:17,750 --> 01:54:20,583
You were in a carriage . I followed on a bike

823
01:54:20,720 --> 01:54:23,382
A horse carriage , followed by a jeep ...

824
01:54:23,523 --> 01:54:25,889
Followed by a bike And me on the bike

825
01:54:28,127 --> 01:54:29,651
Quietly , man ! They might hear us

826
01:54:32,165 --> 01:54:35,191
- Hitchcock ! - Hitchcock always gets it right

827
01:54:35,835 --> 01:54:36,927
Behind you !

828
01:54:37,070 --> 01:54:39,436
People who move ahead never look round

829
01:54:39,572 --> 01:54:41,540
OK , sweetie . Know what I mean ?

830
01:54:41,808 --> 01:54:44,208
Hey ! What 's going on back there ?

831
01:54:44,344 --> 01:54:46,141
Someone 's strangling me

832
01:54:48,581 --> 01:54:51,243
I don 't like this . What 's going on ?

833
01:54:51,885 --> 01:54:53,250
Put me down !

834
01:54:59,626 --> 01:55:01,093
You hit me ! You hit me !

835
01:55:01,227 --> 01:55:02,990
I 'll show you ... No !

836
01:55:03,162 --> 01:55:04,561
Might get arrested

837
01:55:36,095 --> 01:55:37,084
Hey ! Please save me

838
01:55:37,230 --> 01:55:38,697
The big guy 's after me

839
01:55:38,831 --> 01:55:41,732
I don 't know what he wants . But it looks bad

840
01:56:00,453 --> 01:56:02,080
I 've found the keys

841
01:56:14,000 --> 01:56:18,801
Father , today the light has come back into your life

842
01:56:28,247 --> 01:56:29,043
Sameer !

843
01:56:31,651 --> 01:56:32,447
My brother !

844
01:56:33,453 --> 01:56:34,920
You 're really alive ?

845
01:56:37,690 --> 01:56:40,921
Where ... Where have you been all these years

846
01:56:41,761 --> 01:56:44,594
I thought you 'd gone and left me alone here

847
01:56:44,897 --> 01:56:48,025
Maybe this was the Almighty 's wish

848
01:56:48,768 --> 01:56:52,795
But where have you been all these years ?

849
01:56:53,873 --> 01:56:54,897
Baba told me . ..

850
01:56:55,041 --> 01:56:58,010
That bastard was the one who locked him up

851
01:56:58,144 --> 01:57:00,169
Baba was really our enemy

852
01:57:00,346 --> 01:57:02,507
He tried to ruin our whole family

853
01:57:03,416 --> 01:57:06,908
He 's the one who turned Jasmin into an evil witch ...

854
01:57:07,053 --> 01:57:08,384
That 's your Baba !

855
01:57:10,723 --> 01:57:14,056
He 's a devil worshipper , a black magician

856
01:57:14,827 --> 01:57:17,318
He 's used that black magic on Jasmin

857
01:57:17,897 --> 01:57:20,627
That 's why she haunts those lonely woods

858
01:57:21,234 --> 01:57:22,098
Yes , brother !

859
01:57:23,136 --> 01:57:26,765
He cut Jasmin 's hair and dress and made a doll out of it

860
01:57:27,507 --> 01:57:32,137
And he buried that doll in Nakita 's grave

861
01:57:33,913 --> 01:57:37,474
We must remove that doll from Nakita 's grave

862
01:57:38,351 --> 01:57:42,117
Or Nakita 's evil soul will never let go of Jasmin 's body

863
01:57:42,488 --> 01:57:43,853
But where is Jasmin ?

864
01:57:44,557 --> 01:57:45,649
Try her room

865
01:57:54,600 --> 01:57:55,965
Jasmin 's not here

866
01:57:56,335 --> 01:57:57,962
She 's not there either

867
01:57:58,404 --> 01:57:59,928
Where 's Baba gone ?

868
01:58:00,073 --> 01:58:02,906
He 's taken Jasmin back to the dark woods

869
01:58:04,177 --> 01:58:06,475
Tonight will be a moonless night

870
01:58:07,346 --> 01:58:09,610
Tonight , in front of his evil God . ..

871
01:58:10,450 --> 01:58:12,077
... he will sacrifice Jasmin

872
01:58:12,885 --> 01:58:15,786
And then Nakita will live again

873
01:58:16,456 --> 01:58:18,219
Save my daughter , Sameer !

874
01:58:19,058 --> 01:58:21,993
- Save my daughter ! - Don 't worry , father !

875
01:58:22,495 --> 01:58:24,258
I will save Jasmin

876
02:01:01,487 --> 02:01:05,685
Your death will bring about Nakita 's rebirth

877
02:01:06,959 --> 02:01:10,019
You must enter that burning cave

878
02:01:14,433 --> 02:01:16,731
Your body will be burned to ashes

879
02:01:17,069 --> 02:01:21,199
And Nakita 's soul will enter her own body once again

880
02:03:29,835 --> 02:03:31,097
Jasmin !

881
02:03:32,138 --> 02:03:35,107
Jasmin ... . ! Stay where you are !

882
02:03:36,308 --> 02:03:39,038
Stop , my daughter ... Stop

883
02:03:39,512 --> 02:03:42,379
So , Thakur Mahendra Pratap Singh ...

884
02:03:43,382 --> 02:03:46,374
. .. at last you are here

885
02:03:48,954 --> 02:03:50,717
You deceitful rat

886
02:03:52,591 --> 02:03:54,889
You have destroyed my home

887
02:03:55,027 --> 02:03:59,521
The black magic of Mahakal will destroy you if you oppose it

888
02:03:59,732 --> 02:04:03,031
That evil magic has cursed our family

889
02:04:03,602 --> 02:04:07,060
But there is a power even greater than your Mahakal

890
02:04:07,706 --> 02:04:09,469
And that is God Almighty

891
02:04:13,846 --> 02:04:15,746
Stop your devilish laughter !

892
02:04:16,348 --> 02:04:18,373
Now prepare to meet your doom

893
02:04:18,984 --> 02:04:23,648
Tonight I will destroy your citadel of evil

894
02:04:24,056 --> 02:04:25,148
Seize him !

895
02:04:25,724 --> 02:04:27,487
Don 't let him get away

896
02:05:40,165 --> 02:05:42,963
Wait , Thakur ! Don 't make this mistake

897
02:05:44,904 --> 02:05:49,136
By the power of black magic , once this bottle breaks

898
02:05:49,275 --> 02:05:52,506
Nakita will leave your daughter 's body

899
02:05:52,711 --> 02:05:54,110
But you will die

900
02:05:54,313 --> 02:05:58,511
As soon as this bottle breaks , then you will die

901
02:05:59,485 --> 02:06:09,224
I was already dead on the day you bewitched my daughter

902
02:06:10,262 --> 02:06:13,527
If my death will save my daughter 's life

903
02:06:14,900 --> 02:06:16,731
then I accept this death

904
02:06:28,380 --> 02:06:29,312
Father !

905
02:06:55,140 --> 02:06:56,869
Papa , what 's happened to you ?

906
02:06:57,676 --> 02:06:59,644
Daughter , are you all right ?

907
02:06:59,778 --> 02:07:03,475
Tell me , papa . What 's happened to you ?

908
02:08:22,161 --> 02:08:23,856
Sahila , don 't look at her

909
02:08:25,297 --> 02:08:26,662
Don 't look in her eyes !

910
02:09:05,070 --> 02:09:07,436
She will kill you all !

911
02:09:07,906 --> 02:09:10,500
You will all die !

912
02:10:36,428 --> 02:10:38,521
The AUM must be under this statue

913
02:11:20,839 --> 02:11:23,034
Hemant ! Trap her in there !

914
02:13:55,394 --> 02:13:59,990
After even the blackest night can come a bright new morning

915
02:14:00,699 --> 02:14:04,658
Every death is followed by the rebirth of new life and hope

916
02:14:05,437 --> 02:14:07,200
Darkness is driven away

917
02:14:07,639 --> 02:14:09,573
The cycle of seasons starts anew

918
02:14:10,675 --> 02:14:14,702
Behind the secrets of nature lies a greater power

919
02:14:15,414 --> 02:14:22,752
Almighty God ! Whose power vanquishes all evil

